                    <!--<h5>About Projects</h5>-->
                    <p style="font-size: 18px;">MP Agro  is  adopting  cash  basis  of  accounting  and all the expenditure  and income are recorded  and  recognized  on  cash  basis.  Auditors and  management  have  expressed  their  concerns  on inability &amp;  difficulty involved in  determining  the  extent  and  status of  completion of  various  works  and  valuation  thereof. This has impact on ascertaining the true financial position of organization.  The main  objective of this document is to identify and record the business process of  various  interconnected and  interdependent  section of MPAgro with  special  reference  to  its integration,  predefined work flow,   analytical  exceptional reports &amp;  impact on  basis of core &amp; business modules including accounting . This document will also form the basis of automation of   various   activities through implementation of software solution.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
